WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.065
- You're a dad now and your
daughter just turned two.

00:00:03.065 --> 00:00:04.043
(audience cheers and applauds)
- Yeah.

00:00:04.043 --> 00:00:07.064
- This is so cool.
- That's my chookie.

00:00:07.064 --> 00:00:08.160
That's my chookie-chookie.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.350
- I love the 70s party.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.610
- Oh yeah.
- So like-

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.280
- You know, first year was in Kanto.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.980
- Oh, my God. What a first!
What a great first birthday.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:17.970
- Her first year was in Kanto

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.350
and we made her her own magical door too.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.183
It was pretty cool.
- Oh, my gosh.

00:00:23.183 --> 00:00:24.960
I wish I'd given you that picture.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.760
Anyways, I snoozed out.
- I like what I'm creating

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.050
in my head anyway.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.130
It's so magical.
(Wilmer Valderrama laughs)

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.200
Whole art team in my head.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.550
That's amazing though, the 70s thing.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.890
Did you bring out Fez?

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:35.940
For this party?
- Well, what you saw

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.927
me wearing there was one
of Fez's classic outfits.

00:00:39.927 --> 00:00:41.033
(audience laughs)
It was-

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.660
- You still fit in it?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.163
Screw you (laughs)!
- Girl,

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.978
it's called my one hour a day.

00:00:46.978 --> 00:00:48.030
(Kelly and audience laugh and applaud)

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:50.130
- I can promise you my one hour a day

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.842
will not be working out (laughs).

00:00:51.842 --> 00:00:53.070
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.610
My one hour a day will look like this.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:56.443
(Wilmer laughs)

00:00:56.443 --> 00:00:57.990
(laughs) I just wanna sit.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:58.823
I love that.

00:00:58.823 --> 00:01:00.330
The in Kanto birthday. That's so cool.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.147
Wait, what's just happening (laughs)?

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.960
- [Wilmer] It's a long story

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.550
but if you guys go to my Instagram

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.469
I think you'll get more context.

00:01:07.469 --> 00:01:09.540
(audience laughs)
- I am just very happy for you

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:10.500
that you fit in it.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.550
That's incredible.
- Yeah.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.640
- Go you. Go you.
- (audience applauds)

